// Code coverage for the CHERIoT RTOS test SoC: the core (ibex_top) and the CHERIoT memory
// subsystem (cheriot_mem_subsys: tag filter, RMW filter, TRBE, rev_ctl shim, meta SRAM), and
// nothing else. The crossbar, memories, UART, timer, PLIC and rev_ctl are scaffolding.
//
// The build passes -covdut cheriot_rtos_soc. ibex_top is configured by the shared
// dv/coverage/ibex_cover.ccf, exactly as in every other suite; this file only ADDS
// cheriot_mem_subsys on top of it (statement/block/branch/expression/FSM below it, toggle on its
// ports only). Nothing of the shared selection is changed here.
//
// Order matters: the additions come before the include so the shared file's black-boxing of the
// pre-verified prims (deselect ... prim_*...) also applies to prims inside cheriot_mem_subsys.

// Nothing of the SoC by default; the two roots are selected below and in the shared file.
deselect_coverage -betfs -module cheriot_rtos_soc...

// Suite-specific addition: the CHERIoT memory subsystem.
select_coverage -befts -module cheriot_mem_subsys...
deselect_coverage -toggle -module cheriot_mem_subsys...
select_coverage -toggle -module cheriot_mem_subsys

// ibex_top: the same selection as every other suite.
include_ccf ${IBEX_ROOT_DIR}/dv/coverage/ibex_cover.ccf
